msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Upravte strukturu nabídky jako JSON. Každá položka může mít: name, icon, "
"command (spuštěný přes shell) nebo action (akce sezení: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (pole položek) "
"nebo separator (true)."

